<title>CANADA: COM DEV files 8.25 million share public offering.</title>
<headline>COM DEV files 8.25 million share public offering.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Ontario 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>COM DEV International Ltd said on Friday it filed a final prospectus for an initial public offering in Canada of 8.25 million shares at C$8.25 each.</p>
<p>An allotment option could increase the offering to $74.3 million from $68 million, the company said.</p>
<p>The offer was expected to close on or about December 10.</p>
<p>COM DEV is a designer, manufacturer and distributor of wireless communications products and subsystems.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
